 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
   Output: pios1.a, pios1.b
   ->  Hash Semi Join
         Output: pios1.a, pios1.b
         Hash Cond: (pios1.a = pios2.d)
         ->  Index Only Scan using pios1_ab_idx on orca_index_parallel.pios1
               Output: pios1.a, pios1.b
         ->  Hash
               Output: pios2.d
               ->  Redistribute Motion 1:3  (slice2; segments: 1)
                     Output: pios2.d
                     Hash Key: pios2.d
                     ->  Limit
                           Output: pios2.d
                           ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice3; segments: 3)
                                 Output: pios2.d
                                 Merge Key: pios2.d
                                 ->  Limit
                                       Output: pios2.d
                                       ->  Index Only Scan using pios2_de_idx on orca_index_parallel.pios2
                                             Output: pios2.d
 Settings: enable_bitmapscan = 'off', enable_indexscan = 'on', enable_parallel = 'on', enable_seqscan = 'off', optimizer = 'off', parallel_setup_cost = '0'
