-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
   ->  Hash Semi Join
         Hash Cond: (pios1.a = pios2.d)
         ->  Index Only Scan using pios1_ab_idx on pios1
         ->  Hash
               ->  Hash Semi Join
                     Hash Cond: (pios2.d = pios1_1.a)
                     ->  Index Only Scan using pios2_de_idx on pios2
                     ->  Hash
                           ->  Redistribute Motion 1:3  (slice2; segments: 1)
                                 Hash Key: pios1_1.a
                                 ->  Limit
                                       ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice3; segments: 3)
                                             ->  Limit
                                                   ->  Index Only Scan using pios1_ab_idx on pios1 pios1_1
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
