               Output: pbms2.d
               ->  Broadcast Workers Motion 6:6  (slice2; segments: 6)
                     Output: pbms2.d
                     ->  Parallel Bitmap Heap Scan on orca_index_parallel.pbms2
                           Output: pbms2.d
                           Recheck Cond: (pbms2.d < 1000)
                           ->  Bitmap Index Scan on pbms2_d_idx
                                 Index Cond: (pbms2.d < 1000)
